{"sourceUrl":"https://www.zssy.com.cn/article/28869","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:59:47.171315+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://www.zssy.com.cn/article/28869","html":"<div><p><span> </span><span><span>我院现组织开展2026年接收优秀应届本科毕业生推荐免试攻读研究生预报名工作，请符合申请条件的申请人（包括本校应届生）按以下通知内容报名：</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><b>一、申请条件</b></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（一）中华人民共和国公民；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（二）拥护中国共产党的领导，品德良好，遵纪守法；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（三）在目前就读学校取得教育部推荐免试研究生资格的优秀应届本科毕业生；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（四）学术研究兴趣浓厚，具有较强的创新意识、创新能力和作为博士、硕士研究生培养的潜质；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（五）诚实守信，学风端正，未受过任何处分；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（六）身体健康状况符合国家和中山大学规定的体检要求；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（七）入学前须本科毕业并获得学士学位；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（八）其余申请条件要符合中山大学推荐免试研究生招生章程及接收办法中的要求:</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span>1. </span></span></span><span><span><span>医学临床学科（</span></span></span><span><span><span>1002</span></span></span><span><span><span>临床医学、</span></span></span><span><span><span>1003</span></span></span><span><span><span>口腔医学、</span></span></span><span><span><span>1006</span></span></span><span><span><span>中西医结合）学术学位各专业只接受授医学学位的应届本科毕业生申请。</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span>2. </span></span></span><span><span><span>临床医学硕士专业学位只接受本科毕业于</span></span></span><span><span><span>5</span></span></span><span><span><span>年及以上学制的临床医学、麻醉学、精神医学、医学影像学、放射医学、眼视光医学、儿科学等专业的应届本科毕业生申请。</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span>3. </span></span></span><span><span><span>口腔医学硕士专业学位只接受</span></span></span><span><span><span>5</span></span></span><span><span><span>年制口腔医学专业的应届本科毕业生申请。</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span>4. </span></span></span><span><span><span>被录取为临床医学、口腔医学专业学位的学生均须参加住院医师规范化培训。</span></span></span><span><span><span>我院</span></span></span><span><span><span>不接受入学前已获得住院医师规范化培训合格证书的考生报考临床（口腔）医学硕士专业学位。</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span>（</span></span></span><span><span><span>九</span></span></span><span><span><span>）</span></span></span><span><span><span>其余申请条件要符合中山大学推荐免试研究生招生章程及接收办法中的要求。</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p> </p>\n<p><span><span><b>二、招生专业</b></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span>我院拟招生专业请见推免生预报名系统https://enroll.sysu.edu.cn/。</span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>说明：实际招生专业以学校最终公布的2026年研究生招生专业目录为准。各专业实际接收推免生人数将根据招生计划、生源情况等进行调整，以实际录取为准。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><b>三、申请材料</b></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span>1</span></span></span><span><span><span>、</span></span></span><span><span><span>个人简历（限</span></span></span><span><span><span>2</span></span></span><span><span><span>页以内</span></span></span><span><span><span>，扫描</span></span></span><span><span><span>PDF</span></span></span><span><span><span>版</span></span></span><span><span><span>）；</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span>2</span></span></span><span><span><span>、</span></span></span><span><span><span>身份证</span></span></span><span><span><span>PDF</span></span></span><span><span><span>扫描件</span></span></span><span><span><span>（正反面复印在一页</span></span></span><span><span><span>A4</span></span></span><span><span><span>纸上）；</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span>3</span></span></span><span><span><span>、加盖有效注册印章的在校学生证</span></span></span><span><span><span>PDF</span></span></span><span><span><span>扫描件；</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span>4</span></span></span><span><span><span>、加盖教务部门公章的本科阶段成绩单及成绩总评证明</span></span></span><span><span><span>PDF</span></span></span><span><span><span>扫描件；</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span>5</span></span></span><span><span><span>、</span></span></span><span><span><span>英语水平证明材料（</span></span></span><span><span><span>英语四</span></span></span><span><span><span>/</span></span></span><span><span><span>六级或</span></span></span><span><span><span>TOEFL</span></span></span><span><span><span>、</span></span></span><span><span><span>IELTS</span></span></span><span><span><span>、</span></span></span><span><span><span>GRE</span></span></span><span><span><span>、</span></span></span><span><span><span>GMAT</span></span></span><span><span><span>等体现自身英语水平的考试成绩单</span></span></span><span><span><span>PDF</span></span></span><span><span><span>扫描件</span></span></span><span><span><span>）；</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span>6</span></span></span><span><span><span>、公开</span></span></span><span><span><span>发表</span></span></span><span><span><span>的</span></span></span><span><span><span>文章</span></span></span><span><span><span>PDF</span></span></span><span><span><span>扫描件</span></span></span><span><span><span>（需标注出个人姓名）</span></span></span><span><span><span>；</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span>7</span></span></span><span><span><span>、</span></span></span><span><span><span>负责或参与的科研项目</span></span></span><span><span><span>PDF</span></span></span><span><span><span>扫描件</span></span></span><span><span><span>（含项目书盖章页、参与人信息页）</span></span></span><span><span><span>；</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span>8</span></span></span><span><span><span>、</span></span></span><span><span><span>各类获奖证书</span></span></span><span><span><span>PDF</span></span></span><span><span><span>扫描件；</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span>9</span></span></span><span><span><span>、</span></span></span><span><span><span>其他辅助材料等</span></span></span><span><span><span>。</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>申请者须承诺所提供信息、材料及申请身份的真实性。一经查证为不属实或不符合我校招生要求的，我校将取消其申请资格、录取资格、入学资格，已入学的取消学籍。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>申请者若存在有违学术道德、专业伦理、诚实守信等方面的不当行为，一经查实，立即取消其申请资格、录取资格、入学资格，已入学的取消学籍。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><b>四、申请流程</b></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span>推免生的</span></span></span><span><span><span>预</span></span></span><span><span><span>报名</span></span></span><span><span><span>及考核录取均</span></span></span><span><span><span>通过</span></span></span><span><span><span>中山大学</span></span></span><span><span><span>推荐免试攻读研究生</span></span></span><span><span><span>预报名系统</span></span></span><span><span><span>（以下简称</span></span></span><span><span><span>“</span></span></span><span><span><span>预推免</span></span></span><span><span><span>系统</span></span></span><span><span><span>”</span></span></span><span><span><span>，网址</span></span></span><span><span><span>: https://enroll.sysu.edu.cn/</span></span></span><span><span><span>）进行</span></span></span><span><span><span>。</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span>1</span></span></span><span><span><span>、申请者须</span></span></span><span><span><span>即日</span></span></span><span><span><span>起在</span></span></span><span><span><span>“</span></span></span><span><span><span>预推免</span></span></span><span><span><span>系统</span></span></span><span><span><span>”</span></span></span><span><span><span>完成网上</span></span></span><span><span><span>报名。截止报名时</span></span></span><span><span><span>间：</span></span></span><span><span><span>2025</span></span></span><span><span><span>年9月26日</span></span></span><span><span><span>24:00</span></span></span><span><span><span>。</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span>2</span></span></span><span><span><span>、请申请者密切关注我院在</span></span></span><span><span><span>“</span></span></span><span><span><span>预推免</span></span></span><span><span><span>系统</span></span></span><span><span><span>”</span></span></span><span><span><span>及医院官网：</span></span></span><span><span><span>https://www.zssy.com.cn/cat/300</span></span></span><span><span><span>公布的相关信息</span></span></span><span><span><span>。</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><b>五、初审与考核</b></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span>   1.我院对申请材料初审后，通知初审通过的申请人参加复试的时间和具体流程。</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span>   2.复试时间：即日起至9月30日期间分批组织复试录取工作。具体复试录取时间由各复试组自行确定。请推免生源密切留意我院发出的相关复试通知。</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span>   3.</span></span></span><span><span><span>复试方式：线下面试。申请人须按学校及我院报考要求做好复试准备工作，按时参加复试。</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span>4</span></span></span><span><span><span>.</span></span></span><span><span><span>复试原则上实行差额复试，择优录取。直博生及免试硕士生分别排序，免试硕士生学术学位及专业学位考生按成绩从高到低分别排序。</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span>复试以面试为主，考察学生的外语应用能力、专业素质及能力、实践(</span></span></span><span><span><span>实验</span></span></span><span><span><span>)</span></span></span><span><span><span>能力、思想政治素质和品德、心理健康状况等。复试成绩外语应用能力考核占</span></span></span><span><span><span>30</span></span></span><span><span><span>分，专业及综合能力考核占</span></span></span><span><span><span>70</span></span></span><span><span><span>分，满分为</span></span></span><span><span><span>100</span></span></span><span><span><span>分，</span></span></span><span><span><span>60分合格，复试不合格者不予录取。思想品德考核不合格者不予录取。</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><b>六、其他</b></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>1.说明</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>此通知为预报名通知，具体要求以教育部及中山大学2026年推荐免试研究生接收工作相关、接收办法通知为准。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>推免生的报名及录取均通过教育部“全国推荐免试攻读研究生（免初试、转段）信息公开管理服务系统”（以下简称“推免服务系统”，网址: https://yz.chsi.com.cn/tm/）进行。所有推免生（含“免试硕士生”和“直博生”）均需按照教育部、本科所在学校和省市招办要求在规定时间内登录教育部推荐免试服务系统，完成资格审查、填报志愿、缴纳报名费、接受复试确认、接受待录取确认等环节。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>推免复审及体检要求请留意学校及院系后续发布的推免接收办法及相关通知。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>2.联系方式</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span>地址：广东省广州市天河区天河路600号中山大学附属第三医院9号楼708室</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span>电话：020-85253263</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span>邮箱：zssyzs</span></span></span><span><span><span>@</span></span></span><span><span><span>163.com</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span>联系人：吴老师</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n<p><span><span>中山大学附属第三医院</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span>研究生科    </span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>2025年8月14日</span></span><span> </span></p>\n</div>","textSha256":"28de07f0998291863a4e0c3202d31ba3002db51c2dfa1b82e68c8481979d1e9c","textLength":2027,"sourceSha256":"462a01e96defcd5406f5878380ab408ba2e49df3ef39b9886d2c2f3eebb31c71","selector":".field-body","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-97a6f324bc7859f00ec4","title":"2025年中山大学附属第三医院2026年接收优秀应届本科毕业生推荐免试攻读研究生预报名通知","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:59:47.171315+00:00"}
